decision was made by the " [:a {:href "/organizations/1"} "IOC"] " in Luxembourg in 1910, at their 11th Session.  The IOC Membership voted unanimously to accept women in Olympic competition in gymnastics, swimming, and " [:a {:href "/editions/6/sports/TEN"} "tennis"] ".  Originally, the Swedish Olympic Committee planned women’s competitions in the " [:a {:href "/results/4636"} "100 metre freestyle"] " and in " [:a {:href "/results/54043"} "plain high diving"] ".  Eventually, it was decided to also allow women to compete in a " [:a {:href "/results/4648"} "freestyle relay race"] "."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The swimming competitions were held at " [:a {:href "/venues/238"} "Djurgårdsbrunnsviken"] ", an inlet not far from the Stockholm city center.  A stadium set-up was built in the inlet and a swimming course of 100 metres was arranged, bounded on one side by land, on the opposite end by a steamboat pier, and enclosed on each side by pontoons."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/4554"} "100 metres Freestyle, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "6 – 10 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "34"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/4573"} "400 metres Freestyle, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "11 – 14 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "26"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/4585"} "1,500 metres Freestyle, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "6 – 10 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "19"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/4630"} "4 × 200 metres Freestyle Relay, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 – 15 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "5"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/4596"